# Deploy Lane Detail

::summary
The dedicated deploy-lane detail surface in the shell wrapper: circled back, lane title + health pill, Pause lane + Redeploy, meta line, run rows, attempts timeline, and the latest-log block. Lane rows come from the Devices hub group (sidebar Devices row is active); the app detail's Deployments section is the per-app view of the same runs.
::

