::callout[type=note title="Renderer note — deferred"]
The live log tail is `::log-stream` (planned-20), not in this train — the fenced block above stands in. Run-row status nodes color by the deployment contains-match rule (renderer polish).
::

Title-row treatment (G3 pass, WP-N3 08-11): Redeploy KEEPS its label as the meaning-carrying primary. Pause lane also stays labelled — a deliberate deviation from the icon-only intent: the icon registry carries NO pause glyph, and an icon-only button with a missing glyph would render the banned fallback circle; when a pause glyph lands, this button converts on the standard G3 terms (label → `aria-label`, verb `pauseLane` unchanged).
